[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5346457007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477#issuecomment-5346457007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122477","id":5346457007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPqx1rw","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T18:37:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T18:37:55Z","body":"What's the difference between using a projector and an emissive decal? do we need to support this?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5346457007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5352587105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477#issuecomment-5352587105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122477","id":5352587105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPwn_YQ","user":{"login":"DaveTheEggman","id":316468666,"node_id":"U_kgDOEtztug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/316468666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveTheEggman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T07:07:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T07:07:46Z","body":"> What's the difference between using a projector and an emissive decal? do we need to support this?\r\n\r\nI think the main difference is that a projector modifies the light's actual illumination, whereas an emissive decal is just an additional visual contribution. A projector can therefore be used for things like gobos/patterned lighting where you want the texture to affect the surfaces illuminated by the light rather than simply overlaying an emissive/decal texture.\r\nSo IMO this is still worth supporting with `shadow_enabled = false`. The projector doesn't inherently require shadow mapping, it just currently reuses `shadow_matrix` to calculate its projector UVs & disabling shadows was leaving that matrix unwritten. The fix is basically making sure the projector still gets the projection transform it needs without requiring shadow rendering. Otherwise, `light_projector` effectively becomes broken whenever shadows are disabled, which seems like an unintended coupling between two separate features.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5352587105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5353203243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477#issuecomment-5353203243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122477","id":5353203243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPxNmKw","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T08:10:49Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T08:10:59Z","body":"Ok. I didn't have time yet to look at the code in-depth.\r\n\r\nMy concern when i saw this PR is: does it cause expensive shadow operations to run when using a projector?\r\nAlso, is there not a function somewhere to calculate the shadow matrix? You had to reimplement it there?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5353203243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5354486367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477#issuecomment-5354486367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122477","id":5354486367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPyb6Xw","user":{"login":"DaveTheEggman","id":316468666,"node_id":"U_kgDOEtztug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/316468666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveTheEggman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T10:11:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:11:13Z","body":"> Ok. I didn't have time yet to look at the code in-depth.\r\n> \r\n> My concern when i saw this PR is: does it cause expensive shadow operations to run when using a projector? Also, is there not a function somewhere to calculate the shadow matrix? You had to reimplement it there?\r\n\r\nNo, this shouldn't cause the expensive shadow operations to run when only a projector is enabled. The matrix calculation is gated by `has_shadow || has_projector` but the shadow-specific data/setup remains inside `if (has_shadow)`. So with shadows disabled, the only extra work is calculating/storing the projection transform needed by the projector, it doesn't render/update a shadow map or do any of the shadow atlas/PCSS work. For the matrix calculation, I originally reimplemented the fallback projection because the existing spotlight path gets its projection from `light_instance->shadow_transform[0].camera`, which isn't available when shadows aren't active.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5354486367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6332897949","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477#issuecomment-6332897949","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122477","id":6332897949,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeXhanQ","user":{"login":"DaveTheEggman","id":316468666,"node_id":"U_kgDOEtztug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/316468666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveTheEggman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T04:43:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:43:07Z","body":"@Calinou Rebased on top of master & applied your suggestions","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6332897949/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]